  "title": "Chocolate Mint Crinkle Cookies from Reynolds® Parchment Paper",
  "description": "Mint and chocolate meet again in everyone&#39;s&#39; favorite chocolate cookie. Who knew these chocolaty crinkle cookies are so easy to bake?",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
